/-!
# Universal Wire-Free Term Predicate

Defines the ghost- and semantics-independent predicate `NoTrWireU` (`∀ i S g, NoTrWire i S g u`)
together with `SubFunction` instances for unfolding `gamma'` over the composed model.
-/

@[expose] public section

cref_hide_foreign_instances

set_option autoImplicit false

namespace Symbolic.Swarm.CREF.TR.NoTrWireU

cref_open
open DY.DiffieHellman
open DY.Libsignal.TripleRatchet
open CryptoProofLib.Refinement (ExternInterpretation)

attribute [local irreducible] node opaqueNode spqrKeyNode

